[thin] Required wall-conforming TPU collar and axial stop. The tapered collar grows from diameter 11.7 to 17.5 mm between Y3.6 and Y5.9, followed by the Y5.9..7.0 annular stop. This is the flexible retaining collar fitted to the wall's matching ramp and stop; the keeper groove begins at Y7. Installed retention remains physically unqualified.
alternatives: Making the outer stop 3 mm axially would move the keeper groove and rear collar or consume the fitted ramp. Both alternatives change the closed wall seat and insertion geometry.
