[thin] Matched flexible sealing interfaces. Diameter 6.10 mm sealing lands grip the diameter 6.35 mm tube. The front sealing section has 2.80 mm nominal radial stock; the minimum branch stock is 2.81 mm. Entry chamfers and the inlet lead/relief have their fitted local profiles. These local sealing sections follow the manually fitted TPU elbow article linked in the dock README; that observation does not qualify this junction's pressure retention or lifetime. At least one anchor in each group is on a sealing land or its entry cone, as recorded in the native review.
alternatives: A 3 mm wall around the front land requires diameter 12.10 mm and conflicts with the diameter 12.00 mm rigid-wall opening. Thickening free sealing sections changes their fitted cuff compliance. Retain the named sealing geometry and its physical qualification scope.
